the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Company validly founded holds for *a case*.
    Articles of association notarised holds for *a case*.
    Share capital at least eur 25000 holds for *a case*.
    Entered in the commercial register holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Articles of association notarised would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Share capital at least eur 25000 would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_16_company_founding includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/company-founding.ruml".

Company validly founded holds for a case if
    Articles of association notarised holds for the case
    and Share capital at least eur 25000 holds for the case
    and Entered in the commercial register holds for the case.

Articles of association notarised holds for a case if
    Articles of association notarised would hold for the case.

Share capital at least eur 25000 holds for a case if
    Share capital at least eur 25000 would hold for the case.

