    node_1 expects answers ["Company validly founded holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Company validly founded holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_2 expects answers ["Articles of association notarised holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_2 expects answers ["it is not the case that Articles of association notarised holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_3 expects answers ["Share capital at least eur 25000 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_3 expects answers ["it is not the case that Share capital at least eur 25000 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_4 expects answers ["Entered in the commercial register holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_4 expects answers ["it is not the case that Entered in the commercial register holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

